{"id":"steam-5337040","steam":5337040,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Apprentice: Tidy Up The Viking Village!","summary":"After a successful raid, the Vikings brought back more than just loot, they brought chaos! Weapons and shields are scattered in the armory, and the tavern is full of bottles and jugs left over from celebrations. While everyone rests, it's up to you to restore order by sorting 4000+ items!","about":"The Vikings are back from a raid, they've brought plenty of loot, but also left the village in a disarray! While the Vikings are resting, someone is tasked with returning order to their village, and that someone is you!\n\nPick up 4000+ misplaced objects with the ability to carry multiple at once, and find their rightful place using your environment.\n\nUse your abilities to highlight objects or highlight the place an object belongs to for easier cleanup. Go through the mess at your own pace and watch the village go back to its former glory.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5337040/e3757b4afd1c0509c015a4de33af82b863e808e5/library_capsule.jpg?t=1795203065","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5337040/e917665a4c274b4057ce019347c53cef98f8a571/header.jpg?t=1795203065","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5337040/92ecac47c63aa891309419137464c7bd9632d01f/library_hero.jpg?t=1795203065","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5337040/e917665a4c274b4057ce019347c53cef98f8a571/header.jpg?t=1795203065","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5337040/0966ee9021d96cd7ab40608f8bf52b52ad801679/ss_0966ee9021d96cd7ab40608f8bf52b52ad801679.600x338.jpg?t=1795203065","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5337040/0966ee9021d96cd7ab40608f8bf52b52ad801679/ss_0966ee9021d96cd7ab40608f8bf52b52ad801679.jpg?